# Build output and editor state. Everything else this repository contains is source:
# the frontend under wwwroot is hand-written and has no build step (decision 032), so
# nothing here may ignore it.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Local configuration and logs, never versioned (requirement S4).
.env
*.log

# Measured benchmark output, kept out of git by decision 042. The exclusion is whole-directory:
# the measurements and the R script that renders the charts are outside git as well. The run that
# produced it, and how to retrieve any of it from history, is described in benchmarks/README.md.
benchmarks/results/
